1
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:04,320
Right-click a Bid price for a short menu with only the Sell orders.

2
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:08,280
It is headed by the instrument, the side and the price.

3
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:13,100
An Ask price gives the Buy orders. Escape closes the menu.

4
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,660
For the keyboard, first click an instrument in the list.

5
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:19,060
Down and Up move through the list. The chart stays as it is.

6
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:21,960
Enter shows the highlighted instrument on the chart.

7
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:25,760
The Menu key on your keyboard opens the right-click menu.

8
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:31,100
Alt+F jumps to the search box. Escape clears it.

9
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:34,940
Three more columns can be shown. Right-click a column heading.

10
00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:41,040
Choose Customize columns, then tick High, Low and % Chg.

11
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:45,040
High and Low show today's range, and % Chg today's change.

